(3710, 290, 681, 2, '', 'The living room was in good condition with only some minor defects such as the plaster cracking In the corners of the room, other than that the room demonstrated good cleanliness.', NULL, 0, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:35:20', NULL, NULL),
(3711, 290, 682, 1, '', 'The sitting room was also in a good condition with no obvious defects her faults cleanliness was also at a higher standard.', NULL, 0, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:36:09', NULL, NULL),
(3712, 290, 683, 1, '', 'The kitchen is in a good condition with some minor issues like the plaster cracking as shown in the photographs above and also In my inspection came across some kind of object  Sellotaped to the roof as shown in the photographs above aside from that cleanliness was at a high standard and the kitchen was in a good condition overall.', NULL, 0, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:38:26', NULL, NULL),
(3713, 290, 684, 2, 'Double Bedroom 1', 'The first bedroom in the property was in a good condition with no obvious defects and cleanliness was being maintained at a high standard.', NULL, 1, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:40:06', NULL, NULL),
(3714, 290, 684, 1, 'Double Bedroom 2', 'The master bedroom was in a good condition again no obvious defects or fault there were no window restrictors all the light switches were working as normal and cleanliness has been maintained and a good standard.', NULL, 1, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:41:13', NULL, NULL),
(3715, 290, 685, NULL, '', 'For the third and final bedroom again no major defects asides from in the right-hand corner of the roof some mild mould beginning to develop aside from that no major defects cleanliness again was being maintained at a high standard.', NULL, 0, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:42:04', NULL, NULL),
(3716, 290, 686, 2, '', 'The main bathroom was in a decent condition it will need a touchup of paint soon as the plaster is beginning to crack as shown in the photographs above also I found the press might need a touch up soon too, aside from that no major defects and also cleanliness being maintained at a high standard, There were no visible leaks present at the time.', NULL, 0, '2022-09-15 15:30:56', '2022-09-15 15:44:21', NULL, NULL),
